      "text": "They are poorly communicated, leading to confusion about when they begin and end.",  
      "why_wrong": "The text never mentions communication failures or confusion about timing. It focuses on the functional inadequacy of quiet hours as a solution, not on implementation logistics or clarity of rules."  
    },  
