      "text": "They are too short to have a meaningful impact on daily stress levels.",  
      "why_wrong": "While the text notes quiet hours last only a few hours, it does not argue that their duration is insufficient. Instead, it claims the problem lies in the policy’s failure to address the root cause—uncontrolled environments—making this a misreading of the core argument."  
